1
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,500
We need to move fast. The building
is going to collapse any minute.

2
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Jesus Christ, what happened here?

3
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:28,000
Some kind of explosion.
Half the block is gone.

4
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:13,500
God, this is bad. This is really bad.

5
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:34,000
Get me the goddamn radio.
I need to call for backup.

6
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:08,000
Holy shit, there are people
still trapped inside.

7
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:49,000
Oh my God, I am heartily sorry
for having offended Thee.

8
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,500
And I detest all my sins because
of Thy just punishments.

9
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:18,000
That son of a bitch left us here to die.

10
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:33,000
Watch your mouth. There are
children present.

11
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:03,000
Dear God, please get us
out of here alive.

12
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:23,000
For Christ's sake, stop whining
and help me with this door.

13
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:48,000
Lord, hear our prayer.
Lord, graciously hear us.

14
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:13,500
Oh my God, did you see that?
The whole wall just came down!

15
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:33,000
You stupid asshole, you almost
got us all killed.

16
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:03,500
Jesus said love your enemies.
I think that applies even now.

17
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:18,000
Shut the fuck up with your
Bible quotes, padre.

18
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:33,000
Jesus, I trust in You.
Jesus, I trust in You.

19
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:53,000
Oh God, oh God, the ceiling
is coming down!

20
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:18,000
Sweet Jesus, that was close.

21
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:33,500
Hail Mary, full of grace,
the Lord is with thee.

22
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:37,000
Blessed art thou among women,
and blessed is the fruit of thy womb.

23
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:03,000
Thank God, I can see daylight.
We're almost out.

24
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:18,000
Jesus Christ, look at that.
The whole damn building is gone.

25
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:33,000
God bless you all.
Every single one of you.

26
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:48,000
Christ the King parish is
just around the corner.

27
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:03,000
Let's get the hell out of here
before the rest comes down.

28
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:18,500
Oh my God, we made it.
We actually made it.

29
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:34,000
God, why did You let this happen?
Why did You take them from us?

30
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:48,000
The Lord giveth and the
Lord taketh away.
